    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SHERRI: Don't let Suzy out. They're spraying. She'll get cancer. Give her some water.\nSANDY: Take her to my room.",
      "SHEILA: God, I spend all my time trying to get people to concern themselves about ‘their health and the state is dropping poison on us.\nSHEILA: You'll be building up your own business. You can work your own hours. Mostly on the phone. You have children don't you?\nLOIS: That's why I'm ‘interested in making money not spending it.\nSHEILA: But you will, if you...",
      "TESS: I fired ‘em.\nANN: Inside. Look on my dresser.\nANN: Are you sure it'll be safe by Saturday?.",
      "ANN: Well, put in extra chlorine. We won't use it until then.\nANN: Talk to you later, Tess.\nTESS: Yeah. Will you at’ least come over and look at it?",
      "DOREEN: Sure.\nSHERRI: Tell me about Elliot Gould."
    ]
